- Every existing row passes unchanged. In particular:
  - S1, S4, S8, PS4 and D1-D6;
  - 526a2080's N5-N7 and S7-S8;
  - 1c2bfeca's N8 and S9;
  - all of MoeDaemonSupervisorTest, including W31-W35.
